{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b91ed10690cbcfc5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tstrat_id: RHAISTRAT-9009\n3\ttitle: Rename \"Data Science Projects\" navigation label to \"Projects\"\n4\tstatus: Refinement Done\n5\tpriority: Minor\n6\tlabels:\n7\t- refined\n8\tlinks: []\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t## Problem Statement\n12\t\n13\tUsability testing showed the \"Data Science Projects\" navigation label confuses\n14\tusers who arrive from OpenShift, where the same resources are called projects.\n15\tProduct management approved shortening the label to \"Projects\" everywhere it\n16\tappears in the Dashboard UI. No behavior, routing, or API changes are involved\n17\t— this is a user-visible string change plus the corresponding documentation\n18\ttouch-ups.\n19\t\n20\t## High-Level Requirements\n21\t\n22\t| ID | Priority | Requirement |\n23\t|-------|----------|-------------|\n24\t| HLR-1 | P2 | The Dashboard navigation and page headings show \"Projects\" instead of \"Data Science Projects\". |\n25\t| HLR-2 | P2 | Documentation screenshots' captions and references to the old label are updated in the affected topics. |\n26\t\n27\t## Affected Components\n28\t\n29\t- Dashboard\n30\t\n31\t## Out of Scope\n32\t\n33\t- Renaming the underlying Kubernetes resources or CRDs\n34\t- Localization string review beyond the changed label\n35\t\n36\t## Open Questions\n37\t\n38\tNone.\n39\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b4d62495757329b","agent_id":"afb3e21d414e33ec5","session_id":"f8c4b915-d87d-42d2-a672-5eb0b22a4761","uuid":"342084bf-3350-4cbd-a977-1e2678a579b9","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:54:07.438Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b91ed10690cbcfc5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9009"}
